OL,3,ATens of thousands urged to evacuate as
OL,4,Awildfire approaches Reno, Nevada
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials say six people have been
OL,7,Finjured, including three emergency
OL,8,Fresponders, and around 15,000 acres (23
OL,9,Fsq miles) have been burned
OL,11,FWildfires are common in south-west US
OL,12,Fstates, including Nevada, but many of
OL,13,Fthese fires develop in rural and less
OL,14,Fpopulated areas
